om/repos/angular/angular/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/deployments","created_at":"2014-09-18T16:12:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T08:09:26Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-10T23:39:43Z","git_url":"git://github.com/angular/angular.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:angular/angular.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular","homepage":"https://angular.dev","size":616697,"stargazers_count":100153,"watchers_count":100153,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":27109,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1141,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["angular","javascript","pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27109,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**I'm submitting a ...**  (check one with \"x\")\n\n```\n[ ] bug report\n[x] feature request\n[ ] support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\n```\n\n**Current behavior**\n\nWhen animating a container into view, if the container has nested elements / components that are also animated, they all animate together.\n\n**Expected/desired behavior**\n\nBased on the precedence set by Angular 1.x, nested animations should be blocked. Therefore, if a container is currently animating, the nested animations should be ignored. I understand that Angular 2 is a new platform; however, I would argue that the behavior demonstrated in NG1 is actually the _desired_ behavior - that nested animations are rarely desired unless explicitly activated with something like `ng-animate-children`. I think this hold especially true for `ngFor` where the initial rendering of the list shouldn't be animated; but, **new** items to that list should be:\n\nhttp://www.bennadel.com/blog/2765-preventing-animation-during-the-initial-render-of-ngrepeat-in-angularjs.htm\n\nI'm sure there is a way to _work around_ this issue by using a \"state\" or something; but, this would add increased complexity to accomplish what I suggest should be the default behavior.\n\n**Reproduction of the problem**\n\nhttp://plnkr.co/edit/j9EpndSwH6b12tjgCXID?p=preview\n\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\n\nI believe it is a better user experience. And, it is a precedence set by NG1.\n\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\n- **Angular version:** 2.0.0-rc.2\n- **Browser:** all\n- **Language:** TypeScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9335/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":697983172,"node_id":"